{
  "name": "EventZilla — Finance ML Pipeline (Cron + FastAPI + MLflow)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## EventZilla — Finance\n**Grille Partie n8n (Excellent)**\n- **A** Pipeline bout-en-bout : Cron → auth → 2 modèles → fusion → fichier + MLflow.\n- **B** Intégration FastAPI ; **HTTP** + **Cron**.\n- **C** Inférence planifiée ; prédictions persistées via `/save_result`.\n- **D** Workflow d’erreur lié + journaux d’exécution n8n.\n\n**Secrets :** variables `N8N_EZ_FASTAPI_URL`, `N8N_EZ_FINANCE_LOGIN`, `N8N_EZ_FINANCE_PASSWORD` (voir `env.example`).\n\n**Technique :** nœud **Merge** « Combine by Position » pour éviter une double exécution du Code.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-finance-doc",
      "name": "Documentation Pipeline Finance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-120, 60]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": { "interval": [{ "field": "weeks", "weeksInterval": 1 }] }
      },
      "id": "node-cron-finance",
      "name": "Cron — Hebdomadaire (Schedule Trigger)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [280, 400],
      "notes": "Déclencheur planifié (ajuster jour/heure dans l’UI n8n si besoin)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ ($env.N8N_EZ_FASTAPI_URL || 'http://127.0.0.1:8000') + '/auth/login' }}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ login: $env.N8N_EZ_FINANCE_LOGIN || 'naima_sarraj', password: $env.N8N_EZ_FINANCE_PASSWORD || 'Naima@Finance2025!' }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 15000 }
      },
      "id": "node-login-finance",
      "name": "HTTP — Login JWT (Finance)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [520, 400],
      "notes": "Préférer les variables d’environnement pour les mots de passe."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ ($env.N8N_EZ_FASTAPI_URL || 'http://127.0.0.1:8000') + '/predict/regression' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $('HTTP — Login JWT (Finance)').first().json.access_token }}" }]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"id_date\": 1,\n  \"id_event\": 42,\n  \"id_servicecategory\": 3,\n  \"id_benchmark\": 2,\n  \"id_provider\": 7,\n  \"service_price\": 1200,\n  \"benchmark_avg_price\": 1300,\n  \"event_budget\": 2000,\n  \"cal_month\": 4,\n  \"cal_year\": 2024,\n  \"quarter\": 2,\n  \"commission_margin\": 150\n}",
        "options": { "timeout": 20000 }
      },
      "id": "node-regression-finance",
      "name": "HTTP — Prédiction Ridge (final_price)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [780, 260],
      "notes": "Input 1 du Merge (ordre stable)."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ ($env.N8N_EZ_FASTAPI_URL || 'http://127.0.0.1:8000') + '/predict/timeseries?horizon=3' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $('HTTP — Login JWT (Finance)').first().json.access_token }}" }]
        },
        "options": { "timeout": 20000 }
      },
      "id": "node-timeseries-finance",
      "name": "HTTP — Séries temporelles (Holt)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [780, 540],
      "notes": "Input 2 du Merge."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "combine",
        "combineBy": "combineByPosition",
        "numberInputs": 2,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-merge-parallel-finance",
      "name": "Merge — Ridge + Holt (par position)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.merge",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [1040, 400],
      "notes": "Attend les deux branches puis fusionne en un seul item JSON."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const m = $json;\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),\n    workflow_label: 'Finance Pipeline',\n    utilisateur: 'Naïma Sarraj',\n    regression: {\n      montant_predit: m.montant_predit,\n      unite: m.unite,\n      modele: m.modele,\n    },\n    timeseries: {\n      modele_champion: m.modele_champion,\n      horizon_mois: m.horizon_mois,\n      metriques_test: m.metriques_test,\n      note: m.note,\n    },\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "node-shape-finance",
      "name": "Code — Structurer rapport Finance",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1300, 400],
      "notes": "Réorganise le JSON fusionné pour la persistance et MLflow."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ ($env.N8N_EZ_FASTAPI_URL || 'http://127.0.0.1:8000') + '/save_result' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $('HTTP — Login JWT (Finance)').first().json.access_token }}" }]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ workflow: 'finance', data: $json }) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 20000 }
      },
      "id": "node-save-finance",
      "name": "HTTP — Sauvegarder résultats (fichier JSON)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1560, 280],
      "notes": "POST `/save_result` → fichier sous `n8n/results/`."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const p = $('Code — Structurer rapport Finance').first().json;\nconst mt = p.timeseries?.metriques_test || {};\nconst num = (x) => {\n  const v = parseFloat(x);\n  return Number.isFinite(v) ? v : 0;\n};\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    experiment_name: 'n8n_Finance_Pipeline',\n    run_name: 'finance_n8n_' + new Date().toISOString().replace(/[:.]/g, '-'),\n    params: {\n      workflow: 'finance',\n      user: 'naima_sarraj',\n      model_regression: String(p.regression?.modele || ''),\n      model_timeseries: String(p.timeseries?.modele_champion || ''),\n    },\n    metrics: {\n      predicted_amount: num(p.regression?.montant_predit),\n      timeseries_rmse: num(mt.rmse),\n      timeseries_mape: num(mt.mape),\n      timeseries_r2: num(mt.r2),\n    },\n    tags: { source: 'n8n', pipeline: 'finance', automated: 'true' },\n    artifacts: { fusion: p },\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "node-mlflow-prep-finance",
      "name": "Code — Payload MLflow (métriques numériques)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1560, 520],
      "notes": "Compatibilité `MLflowLogRequest` : métriques scalaires + artifacts."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ ($env.N8N_EZ_FASTAPI_URL || 'http://127.0.0.1:8000') + '/mlflow/log_prediction' }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [{ "name": "Authorization", "value": "=Bearer {{ $('HTTP — Login JWT (Finance)').first().json.access_token }}" }]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": { "timeout": 30000 }
      },
      "id": "node-mlflow-log-finance",
      "name": "HTTP — Logger run MLflow (tracking)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1820, 520],
      "notes": "Journalisation centralisée des runs."
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Cron — Hebdomadaire (Schedule Trigger)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "HTTP — Login JWT (Finance)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "HTTP — Login JWT (Finance)": {
      "main": [[
        { "node": "HTTP — Prédiction Ridge (final_price)", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "HTTP — Séries temporelles (Holt)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
      ]]
    },
    "HTTP — Prédiction Ridge (final_price)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Merge — Ridge + Holt (par position)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "HTTP — Séries temporelles (Holt)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Merge — Ridge + Holt (par position)", "type": "main", "index": 1 }]]
    },
    "Merge — Ridge + Holt (par position)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Code — Structurer rapport Finance", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Code — Structurer rapport Finance": {
      "main": [[
        { "node": "HTTP — Sauvegarder résultats (fichier JSON)", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
        { "node": "Code — Payload MLflow (métriques numériques)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
      ]]
    },
    "Code — Payload MLflow (métriques numériques)": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "HTTP — Logger run MLflow (tracking)", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1",
    "saveManualExecutions": true,
    "errorWorkflow": "EventZilla — Error Handler"
  },
  "tags": [{ "name": "EventZilla" }, { "name": "Finance" }, { "name": "ML" }]
}
